cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "EvoNIDS: Evidence-Driven Adaptive Network Intrusion Detection System"
message: >-
  If you use EvoNIDS in your work, please cite it using this metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: Root
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-28"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/USERNAME/EvoNIDS" # replace USERNAME with the actual account before publishing
abstract: >-
  EvoNIDS is an evidence-driven adaptive network intrusion detection system
  that combines a Nuxt 4 operations console with a FastAPI backend for sensor
  registration, idempotent Suricata EVE ingestion, dataset profiling,
  reproducible CPU baseline model training, rule lifecycle replay validation,
  and evidence-grounded alert triage.
keywords:
  - intrusion detection
  - network security
  - machine learning
  - Suricata EVE
  - FastAPI
  - Nuxt
